---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Before & After Gallery"
description: "Before-and-after smile transformations from Dr. Matthew Phillips at 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, AZ. Real patient results, shared with consent."
permalink: /before-after-gallery/
noindex: true
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Before & After Gallery", url: "/before-after-gallery/" }
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Before &amp; After Gallery</div>
    <h1>Real Smiles, <span>Real Transformations</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Every case below is Dr. Phillips&rsquo; own work &mdash; from a single restored tooth to a full smile makeover. Shared with patient consent.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section-cream">
  <div class="container">

    <!-- CONFIRM: photos are published only with signed HIPAA photo-release
         consent. Keep `noindex: true` in the front matter until consent for
         public display is documented for every case shown here. -->

    <div class="ba-gallery">
      {% for c in beforeAfter %}
      <article class="ba-card fade-in">
        <div class="ba-pair">
          <figure class="ba-shot">
            <img src="{{ c.before }}" alt="Before: {{ c.title }} — patient of Dr. Matthew Phillips" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800">
            <figcaption class="ba-badge ba-badge-before">Before</figcaption>
          </figure>
          <div class="ba-arrow" aria-hidden="true">
            <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" width="22" height="22" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </div>
          <figure class="ba-shot">
            <img src="{{ c.after }}" alt="After: {{ c.title }} — patient of Dr. Matthew Phillips" loading="lazy" width="800" height="800">
            <figcaption class="ba-badge ba-badge-after">After</figcaption>
          </figure>
        </div>
        <div class="ba-caption">
          <h2>{{ c.title }}</h2>
          <p>{{ c.treatment }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="ba-cta fade-in">
      <h2>Wondering what&rsquo;s possible for your smile?</h2>
      <p>Results vary from person to person, but the first step is the same: an honest conversation about what&rsquo;s realistic for you.</p>
      <div class="btn-row" style="justify-content:center">
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-primary" data-action="request-appointment">Schedule a Consultation</a>
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phone.telShort }}" class="btn-outline btn-outline-dark" data-action="call-gallery">Call {{ site.phone.display }}</a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
